## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

**Q:** "Two users edit the same meal."
> *"Each row has a version. Updates succeed only if the version still matches. The loser gets 409 with the current row and has to reload. I don't hold a DB lock for the whole edit session — that would block the other phone for minutes."*

